        "content": "<p>The CI for my PR <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/34636\">34636</a> does not pass because of a simp-normal form issue, as you can see in the screenshot below.<br>\n<img alt=\"Screenshot 2026-03-15 at 3.05.51 PM.png\" class=\"inline-image\" data-original-content-type=\"image/png\" data-original-dimensions=\"2418x238\" data-original-src=\"/user_uploads/3121/KgyZg__RKsw2QFhp3O-S-qYL/Screenshot-2026-03-15-at-3.05.51-PM.png\" src=\"/user_uploads/thumbnail/3121/KgyZg__RKsw2QFhp3O-S-qYL/Screenshot-2026-03-15-at-3.05.51-PM.png/840x560.webp\"><br>\nI can't really tell the difference between line 143 and line 145. May someone help me figure out what I did wrong?</p>",
