    {
        "content": "<p>We could use <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Lean.Meta.addPPExplicitToExposeDiff#doc\">docs#Lean.Meta.addPPExplicitToExposeDiff</a> perhaps? (the same thing that e.g. happens for type mismatches)</p>",
